        {
            "name": "6. Permissions",
            "description": "\nThe read-only permission catalog, grouped exactly as the panel's Roles\nscreen groups it. A Flutter role-editing screen renders this directly.\n\nPermissions are defined in code (RoleAndPermissionSeeder) and synced on\nevery deploy, so there is deliberately no create\/update\/delete here \u2014 a\npermission invented at runtime would be one nothing ever checks.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "List permissions",
                    "request": {
                        "url": {
                            "host": "{{baseUrl}}",
                            "path": "api\/v1\/permissions",
                            "query": [],
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}\/api\/v1\/permissions"
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
